{"seq":3,"slug":"metaprogramming","title":"元编程","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"advanced-decorators","title":"装饰器进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/advanced-decorators","wordCount":835,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"descriptors","title":"描述符与属性协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/descriptors","wordCount":861,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"metaclasses","title":"元类与类工厂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/metaclasses","wordCount":801,"readingTime":4},{"seq":4,"slug":"code-generation","title":"代码生成与 AST","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/code-generation","wordCount":784,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"元编程-简介\">元编程 简介</h1><p>元编程（Metaprogramming）是&quot;编写操作代码的代码&quot;。Python 凭借其动态特性，提供了从装饰器到元类的完整元编程工具链。本章深入讲解 Python 元编程的四大核心技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>01</td>\n<td>装饰器进阶</td>\n<td>参数化装饰器、类装饰器、装饰器栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>02</td>\n<td>描述符与属性协议</td>\n<td><code>__get__</code>/<code>__set__</code>、property 原理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>03</td>\n<td>元类与类工厂</td>\n<td><code>__new__</code>/<code>__init_subclass__</code>、type</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>04</td>\n<td>代码生成与 AST</td>\n<td>ast 模块、exec/eval、代码模板</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[装饰器] --&gt; B[描述符]&#10;  B --&gt; C[元类]&#10;  A --&gt; D[dataclasses / attrs]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[代码生成 / AST]\">graph LR\n  A[装饰器] --&gt; B[描述符]\n  B --&gt; C[元类]\n  A --&gt; D[dataclasses / attrs]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[代码生成 / AST]</pre><h2 id=\"核心观点\">核心观点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>装饰器优先</strong>：90% 的元编程需求可用装饰器解决，元类是最后手段</li>\n<li><strong>描述符是基石</strong>：<code>property</code>、<code>classmethod</code>、<code>staticmethod</code> 底层都是描述符协议</li>\n<li><strong>约定优于魔法</strong>：元编程虽强大，但过度使用会降低代码可读性</li>\n<li><strong>现代替代</strong>：<code>dataclasses</code> 和 <code>attrs</code> 封装了常见的元编程模式</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>Python 闭包与高阶函数</li>\n<li>类的继承与 MRO（方法解析顺序）</li>\n<li><code>__dunder__</code> 特殊方法的基本概念</li>\n</ul>\n"}